
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verify & Continue - Spotify Pro</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #121212;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      background: #202020;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #1ed760;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      color: #aaa;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      margin: 18px 0 8px;
    }

    input, select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #303030;
      border: 1px solid #444;
      border-radius: 7px;
      color: white;
      outline: none;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-top: 25px;
      background: #1ed760;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    a {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #aaa;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Verify & Continue</h1>
    <p>Enter the OTP sent to your registered email and choose your payment method.</p>

    <form action="/pro/verify-otp" method="POST">

      <label>Email OTP</label>
      <input
        type="text"
        name="otp"
        placeholder="Enter 6-digit OTP"
        maxlength="6"
        pattern="[0-9]{6}"
        inputmode="numeric"
        required
      >

      <button type="submit">Continue to Payment →</button>
    </form>

    <a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
